\newlabel{fig:hist}{{4}{6}{All thresholds on $x$ kept in the final trees, one panel per trading rate, $k=0.02$; \emph {top:} edge 0.05, \emph {bottom:} edge 0.10. The target is $d=0$ at every rate; $x$ has standard deviation 1. Bars at $\pm 1.5$ collect thresholds beyond the axis (tail leaves)}{figure.caption.5}{}}
